ffectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Jobs"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Around the world, people have different working hours. In North America, people usually work from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In some European countries, people work from 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. Then they have a break, called a <span class=\"italic\">siesta </span> until 3 p.m. They work again from 3 p.m. to 8 p.m."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Using Modals to Introduce an Opinion"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the following phrases, including modals, to introduce your opinion or your suggestions to someone else:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I think you should \u2026<br /><br />I think you could \u2026"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think you should come tomorrow for training."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think you could get a job here!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to interrupt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to say something when another person is talking"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm sorry to interrupt. Can I ask a question?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to clash"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to disagree"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That schedule clashes with my classes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "couple"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "two of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can work a couple of days a week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " perfect "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having no mistakes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those days are perfect for me - thank you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shift"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "period of time to work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have a morning or an evening shift."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " business card "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a card with the name and phone number of a person or company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could you give me your business card, please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "training "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of teaching someone for a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should come tomorrow for training."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le02ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find out about a work day in a different country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph (5 - 6 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out: what their work hours are, what days they work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share the information with your class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about jobs and work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I find out about work hours and work days."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read it clearly to my partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}